# MusiXs Cloud SQL (Supabase PostgreSQL) Configuration
# 1. Create a free account at https://supabase.com
# 2. Create a new project (e.g. "musixs-db")
# 3. Go to Project Settings > API and copy your Project URL & Anon Public Key:
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key

# MusiXs Real Email Verification Code Dispatcher
# Configure ONE of the options below to send real 6-digit codes to users' Gmail inboxes:

# Option A: Resend API (Recommended - Free 3,000 emails/month, 1 min setup at https://resend.com)
EXPO_PUBLIC_RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_api_key_here

# Option B: EmailJS (Free 200 emails/month at https://emailjs.com)
# EXPO_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id
# EXPO_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id
# EXPO_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key

# Option C: Brevo API (Free 300 emails/day at https://brevo.com)
# EXPO_PUBLIC_BREVO_API_KEY=xkeysib_your_api_key_here
